Package: ihcQuantificationSkill
Type: Project
Title: Reproducible DAB IHC and Immunofluorescence Quantification Workflow
Version: 2.3.0.3
X-Release-Version: 2.3.0-rc3
Authors@R: person("IHC/IF Quantification Skill", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.invalid")
Description: A script-based R and EBImage workflow for auditable brightfield DAB-IHC and multi-channel immunofluorescence (IF) quantification. Provides whole-tissue default analysis, reviewed ROI support, four measurement domains, colocalization, puncta quantification, and biological-unit-level figures.
